      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Cameron, is one of the most knowledgeable people in the solar industry. His knowledge about all aspects of solar systems is truely second to none. Cameron does not push any aspect of the required system and listens to the customer's thoughts and requirements. Due to the fact we had only been in our home for 6 month and had a limited usage profile Cameron suggested we wait to install batteries until we had a true picture of our needs over a longer term. Cameron even suggested we have our meter upgraded prior to installing our solar system. This meant that we were seeing the benefits of our system from day one.  As I am an electrician by trade Cameron worked with be to install the equipment where I wanted it and I have to highlight this was not an easy job to do but he did it. We both felt it was worth the extra effort. The installation was done with a lot of thought for future needs and the site was left as it was found. Customer service has been exceptional.",
